				<title>绿卒子</title>
				<link>http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/green-pawn</link>
				<description>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Site-40&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/julian-the-darkness&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5334587&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607196348&quot; alt=&quot;Julian the Darkness&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5334587)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/julian-the-darkness&quot;  &gt;Julian the Darkness&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
