p-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/m-element-s-personnel-file/Own_scp-012.png" alt="Own_scp-012.png" class="image" /><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/m-element-s-personnel-file/Own-SCP-035.gif" title="佔據面具" alt="Own-SCP-035.gif" class="image" /><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/m-element-s-personnel-file/Own_scp-173-0.png" alt="Own_scp-173-0.png" class="image" /><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/m-element-s-personnel-file/Own_scp-426-I-am-a-toaster.png" title="我是一台烤土司機" alt="Own_scp-426-I-am-a-toaster.png" class="image" /><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/m-element-s-personnel-file/Own_scp-682.png" title="!不滅孽蜥" alt="Own_scp-682.png" class="image" /><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/m-element-s-personnel-file/Own_scp-2521_%E2%97%8F%E2%97%8F_%E2%97%8F%E2%97%8F%E2%97%8F%E2%97%8F%E2%97%8F_%E2%97%8F%E2%97%8F_%E2%97%8F.png" title="●●|●●●●●|●●|●" alt="Own_scp-2521_●●_●●●●●_●●_●.png" class="image" /><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/m-element-s-personnel-file/Own_scp-3900.png" title="狼之網路" alt="Own_scp-3900.png" class="image" /><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/m-element-s-personnel-file/Own_scp-cn-877.png" title="電視人" alt="Own_scp-cn-877.png" class="image" /></div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">隱藏</a></div> </div> </div> <div style="text-align: right;"> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">他人創作</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">隱藏</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div style="text-align: left;"> <h2><span>文</span></h2> <ul> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/34ba3">叄肆奇妙冒险第③话</a> - 於某個世界線中作為敵人襲擊Site-CN-34<span style="text-decoration: line-through;">，悶騷的中二</span></li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/y">鍾情</a> - 只有楓樹<span style="text-decoration: line-through;">，背景</span></li> </ul> <hr /> <ul> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/page-and-view-m-element">文语谈 第八期：素素</a> 關於自己的一些例子吧</li> </ul> <h2><span>圖</span></h2> <div class="image-container aligncenter"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/m-element-s-personnel-file/MEbyBread.jpg" title="女體化+SCP-CN-177" width="200px" alt="MEbyBread.jpg" class="image" /></div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/breaddddd" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3471238&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607196351" alt="breaddddd" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3471238)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/breaddddd" >breaddddd</a></span><br /></p> <div class="image-container aligncenter"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/m-element-s-personnel-file/Ice0.jpg" title="沒有楓葉的冰棒" width="200px" alt="Ice0.jpg" class="image" /></div> <div class="image-container aligncenter"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/m-element-s-personnel-file/Ice.jpg" title="楓葉的冰棒" width="200px" alt="Ice.jpg" class="image" /></div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/silverice" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3693063&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607196351" alt="silverIce" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3693063)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/silverice" >silverIce</a></span></p> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">隱藏</a></div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">大概是人設</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">隱藏</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <h1><span>3級研究員Maple Element的人事檔案 (Beta 4.1)</span></h1> <div class="scp-image-block block-right" style="width:300px;"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/m-element-s-personnel-file/Maple1.jpg" style="width:300px;" alt="Maple1.jpg" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:300px;"> <p>一次由研究員元楓顯現出的異常效應，注意背景的顏色變化。（拍攝於Site-███，符合該研究員現所在地）</p> </div> </div> <p><strong>真名：</strong>██████ ███（███）</p> <ul> <li>現使用Maple Element（元楓）名義</li> </ul> <p><strong>性別：</strong><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">[已編輯]</span>男</p> <p><strong>通稱：</strong>Element，或是元素、<span style="text-decoration: line-through;">素素</span>、楓葉、Maple等等(通常以第<span style="text-decoration: line-through;">三</span>一個稱呼最為常見)<span style="text-decoration: line-through;">因為Maple這稱呼通常用在女性</span></p> <p><strong>職位：</strong>文書管理員，<span style="text-decoration: line-through;">偶爾兼任特工</span></p> <p><strong>安保權限等級：</strong>3</p> <p><strong>所屬單位：</strong><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">Site-CN-██</span> Area-CN-42</p> <p><strong>專長：</strong>色彩學、心靈哲學、生死學、數學、[數據刪除]</p> <p><strong>性格：</strong>消極厭世，此外無太多明顯性格</p> <p>瞳孔顏色每天都會變化，頂著有些淺的<span style="text-decoration: line-through;">染出來的</span>橘褐色頭髮為特徵。體型普通，身高中等。外表看來約25歲，實際不明。加入SCP基金會時間已經丟失。</p> <p>基本都在擺臭臉，但其表示“這只是習慣，不代表我對工作有怨言。” ；公事常常只用最低標準來完成，如果被人指點會明顯擺出不滿的表情。</p> <p>除上述專長外，對於飲食也略有涉獵，但止步於嘗鮮的程度。</p> <p>喜愛以旁觀者角度觀察他人處於大難之中來獲得樂趣；但極少主動，或者完全不想讓自己捲入任何事件中；然而，目前已有多分收容突破報告顯示，該研究員皆出現於距離事件位置不到██公尺的地點。</p> <p>似乎對楓葉情有獨鍾，偶爾會見到其待在（憑空出現的）楓樹下。</p> <p>消極的程度大概是當世界末日時只會原地不動的那一種。[對此表示懷疑]</p> <p><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">目前懷疑其與<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-2046">SCP-2046</a>跟<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-2300">SCP-2300</a>有所關聯。</span></p> <p>該人員負面情緒極強，並以此發洩於畫筆上，造成其作畫基本會[數據刪除]，偶爾會產生[數據損毀]。上層目前考慮沒收其所有繪畫工具。</p> <div class="circle-1 circle-left sushi"> <div class="graph-box"> <div class="graph"></div> <div class="graph"></div> <div class="graph"></div> <div class="graph"></div> <div class="graph"></div> <div class="graph"></div> </div> <div class="scale-box"> <div class="scale"></div> <div class="scale"></div> <div class="scale"></div> <div class="scale"></div> <div class="scale"></div> <div class="scale"></div> <div class="scale"></div> <div class="scale"></div> <div class="scale"></div> <div class="scale"></div> </div> <div class="line-box"> <div class="line"></div> <div class="line"></div> <div class="line"></div> <div class="line"></div> <div class="line"></div> <div class="line"></div> </div> <div class="label-box"> <div class="label"> <p>機動力</p> </div> <div class="label"> <p>耐久力</p> </div> <div class="label"> <p>攻擊力</p> </div> <div class="label"> <p>異常性</p> </div> <div class="label"> <p>權限</p> </div> <div class="label"> <p>再生力</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">隱藏</a></div> </div> </div> </div> <p><br /> <br /></p> <div style="display: inline-block; border-radius: 10px; border:solid 2px ##db4c00; background:#ffe5c1; float:top; width:96.5%; padding:10px"> <p><a href="http://scpsandboxcn.wikidot.com/collab:mtf">主站完整MTF列表(未翻譯完)</a><br /> <a href="http://scpsandboxcn.wikidot.com/element-management">沙盒。</a></p> <div style="text-align: center;"> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">代碼1</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">隱藏</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <h3><span>中分原創SCP數：</span></h3> <h4><span>10分以上：</span></h4> <h4><span>現存原創SCP</span></h4> <h3><span>中分原創故事數</span></h3> <h3><span>中分含&quot;原創&quot;的頁面</span></h3> <h3><span>已翻譯SCP數</span></h3> <h3><span>已翻譯主站SCP數</span></h3> <h3><span>已翻譯故事數</span></h3> <h3><span>非原創頁面數</span></h3> <h3><span>全部頁面總和</span></h3> <p>自己統計用</p> </div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">隱藏</a></div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">代碼2</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">隱藏</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">隱藏</a></div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">代碼3</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">隱藏</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">隱藏</a></div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">代碼4</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">隱藏</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">隱藏</a></div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">代碼5</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">隱藏</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">隱藏</a></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/m-element" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2941964&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607196351" alt="M Element" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2941964)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/m-element" >M Element</a></span></p> 
